          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:944cb6e1cc0d0c339d50f767d103dc5428e22850faa595393f4705d07393abd0:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_021e150e31d0421b816095139872a317",
      "statement": "`FIDCallback` enforces collective-count invariance under DDP (ADR-0030) by performing an error-flag `all_reduce(MAX)` rendezvous before each reduction-bearing step in `on_validation_epoch_end`. Any rank-local exception sets the flag locally, the rendezvous fires, and every rank takes the same abort branch together (`val/fid=+inf`); a rank-local exception cannot strand peers in a missing `all_reduce`. The number and order of collectives is identical on every rank in every code path.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/0030-fid-callback-split.md#L129-L146",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:49533f4dbd7d04347bd88195a6191cdd0f680fe474e300774b8b0ce1f2119093:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/fid/callback.py#L215-L386",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1e4e4650b702ab4868ee3927c47f157aa9d149c5e818a51b62053ab71a4cabe5:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/test_fid_helpers.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:c25cb14fb82c2691896515aa5753a4c8e611e9d72ca395ae5d090373922d94ae"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_08ca78080291414fba442877c3a4c975",
      "statement": "`PairedFidelityCallback` DDP evaluation is redundant (not sharded): every rank evaluates the same fixed paired subset under the same seeded noise on DDP-synchronized weights, so the per-rank result is identical and the cross-rank reduction is just Lightning's `torchmetrics` sync on the two module-attached `MeanMetric` instances. There is no FID-style sharding and no error-rendezvous machinery on this path — collective-count invariance holds trivially.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py#L23-L28",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ba6a13830858b38c8b9c8557d0b6a81db7e3310eca473cc171473a75217acf4d:"
        },
        {
