    {
      "id": "claim_f9a06d89726744a1b8503269a7a66522",
      "statement": "Manual `all_reduce` and `sync_dist=True` must never be combined for the same value: the two reductions double-count and yield a mean-of-rank-means (or worse), not the true sample-weighted global mean. `train/loss_epoch` and `val/x0_mae` migrated to module-attached `torchmetrics.MeanMetric` (weighted by batch sample count) for this reason — naive `sync_dist=True` would be exact only under equal per-rank batch counts, which DDP padding happens to guarantee today but a future non-padding sampler would break.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/prd/ddp-correctness.md#L78-L83",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a8ef3794967cc5c3da4730ff1020c213191d822555c4bb18ac17e0d63357482a:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/metrics.py#L15-L107",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:01d6d0e381cf3721703196b860b94dc581a9ac67e6b477548e205695314d4bba:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/test_ddp_metrics.py#L31-L70",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d8c247b2a4a6b1cb03d3458c57b03c7d5963122bfffbe1b8bd3aee57ecb35460:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_337e9aeacb5f4140ba7716c5b3091ab9",
      "statement": "Empty FID shards contribute zero sufficient statistics `(sum_x, sum_xxT, n=0)` of the probed `_feat_dim` rather than skipping the per-plane `all_reduce`; the collective cannot deadlock, and covariance validity is checked only after the global reduction (the global count must be at least 2 for a plane's FID to be computed). One-sample local shards remain valid and must contribute their first/second-order sums — the unbiased covariance's `n-1` denominator depends on the global count, not the local count.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/0025-all-ddp-validation-no-rank0-gate.md#L26-L34",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5683edfd0bb3492dd386d1310c74d53aaa2cf72d750340cec373127755bdebdc:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/fid/callback.py#L182-L205",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a97800061d4d20bf30357995b3ea5937c9cd9ab90213257f3f6b58a105d22508:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/fid/callback.py#L295-L362",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c6a61b91912f6aa7f4398a48f6f2e77162adfd0b30ef67fbe6a099dc1b5aa1b3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0f78b8fc1cf34065a2c912fc7ca156a2",
      "statement": "Rank-strided FID seeds (`FixedSampleRollout` uses `seed + i` for `i % world == rank`) ensure the global synth set is the union across ranks rather than `world ×` rank 0; a non-strided seed would generate `num_synth * world` volumes per rank and silently distort `val/fid`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/0025-all-ddp-validation-no-rank0-gate.md#L36-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e7e13a5ff038be58300c530886fa36ff9b8d28394e587a3e50b5b5854f7576f7:"
        },
